* Constant On-Time Lab -- simplified clock-set, current-reset controller
* Requires COT_ONESHOT.lib in the calling deck. This is an educational
* continuous/sampled hybrid, not a transistor- or vendor-level controller.

* PEAK_CURRENT_CONTROLLER CLOCK VCMD ISENSE RAMP BLANK GATE TRIP READY
* BLANK high suppresses the current comparator. The one-shot supplies the
* latch-like clock set and maximum-on-time reset behavior.
.SUBCKT PEAK_CURRENT_CONTROLLER CLOCK VCMD ISENSE RAMP BLANK
+ GATE TRIP READY PARAMS:
+ TMAX=1.8u TOFFMIN=20n VLOGIC=1 VSOFT=1m
ECMP CMP0 0 VALUE={LIMIT(0.5*VLOGIC*(1+
+ TANH((V(ISENSE)+V(RAMP)-V(VCMD))/VSOFT)),0,VLOGIC)}
EBLANKOK BLANKOK 0 VALUE={VLOGIC*(1-LIMIT(V(BLANK)/VLOGIC,0,1))}
ETRIP TRIP 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(CMP0)*V(BLANKOK)/VLOGIC,0,VLOGIC)}
XSHOT CLOCK TRIP GATE READY COT_ONESHOT PARAMS:
+ TON={TMAX} TOFFMIN={TOFFMIN} VLOGIC={VLOGIC}
RTRIP TRIP 0 1G
.ENDS PEAK_CURRENT_CONTROLLER

* Transconductance outer error amplifier with bounded output command.
* GM_ERROR_AMP FB REF VCMD
.SUBCKT GM_ERROR_AMP FB REF VCMD PARAMS:
+ GM=200u CCOMP=100n RLEAK=1MEG VMIN=50m VMAX=2
GERR 0 COMP VALUE={GM*(V(REF)-V(FB))}
CCOMP COMP 0 {CCOMP} IC={VMIN}
RLEAK COMP 0 {RLEAK}
ECLAMP VCMD 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(COMP),VMIN,VMAX)}
RVCMD VCMD 0 1G
.ENDS GM_ERROR_AMP
